{"path":"io/c/fputwc","title":"std::fputwc","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>fputwc","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/io/c/fputwc","section":"io","kind":"page","summary":"Writes a wide character ch to the given output stream stream.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/cwchar\">&lt;cwchar&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/wide\"><span class=\"kw3618\">std::<span class=\"me2\">wint_t</span></span></a> fputwc<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">wchar_t</span> ch, <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c/FILE\"><span class=\"kw1893\">std::<span class=\"me2\">FILE</span></span></a><span class=\"sy2\">*</span> stream <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/wide\"><span class=\"kw3618\">std::<span class=\"me2\">wint_t</span></span></a> putwc<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">wchar_t</span> ch, <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c/FILE\"><span class=\"kw1893\">std::<span class=\"me2\">FILE</span></span></a><span class=\"sy2\">*</span> stream <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Writes a wide character <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">ch</span></code> to the given output stream <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">stream</span></code>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> May be implemented as a macro and may evaluate <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">stream</span></code> more than once.</div>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> ch\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> wide character to be written\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> stream\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> the output stream\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">ch</span></code> on success, <span class=\"t-lc\">WEOF</span> on failure. If an encoding error occurs, <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/error/errno\">errno</a></span> is set to <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/error/errno_macros\">EILSEQ</a></span>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;cerrno&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;clocale&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;cstdio&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;cstdlib&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;cwchar&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;initializer_list&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/setlocale\"><span class=\"kw2006\">std::<span class=\"me2\">setlocale</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/LC_categories\"><span class=\"kw2009\">LC_ALL</span></a>, <span class=\"st0\">\"en_US.utf8\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"kw1\">for</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw4\">wchar_t</span> ch <span class=\"sy4\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n        L<span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es3\">\\u2200</span>'</span>, <span class=\"co1\">// Unicode name: \"FOR ALL\"</span>\n        L<span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span>,\n        L<span class=\"st0\">'∀'</span>,\n    <span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"kw1\">if</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw2\">errno</span> <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">0</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">fputwc</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>ch, <span class=\"kw2\">stdout</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> WEOF<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n            <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c/puts\"><span class=\"kw1847\">std::<span class=\"me2\">puts</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw2\">errno</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/error/errno_macros\"><span class=\"kw820\">EILSEQ</span></a>\n                <span class=\"sy4\">?</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"Encoding error in fputwc\"</span>\n                <span class=\"sy4\">:</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"I/O error in fputwc\"</span>\n            <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n            <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/program/EXIT_status\"><span class=\"kw977\">EXIT_FAILURE</span></a><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n        <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/program/EXIT_status\"><span class=\"kw976\">EXIT_SUCCESS</span></a><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Possible output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>∀\n∀</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c/fputc\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>fputc</span><span>putc</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  writes a character to a file stream <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c/fputws\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>fputws</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  writes a wide string to a file stream <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c/fgetwc\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>fgetwc</span><span>getwc</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  gets a wide character from a file stream <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div class=\"t-dsc-see\"><span><a href=\"/w/c/io/fputwc\">C documentation</a></span> for <span class=\"t-dsc-see-tt\"><span>fputwc</span></span></div>\n</td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"io","title":"Input/output library"},{"path":"io/c","title":"C-style file input/output"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::fputwc","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"2 declarations. Writes a wide character ch to the given output stream stream."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"ch, stream"},{"label":"Return value","note":"ch on success, WEOF on failure. If an encoding error occurs, errno is set to EILSEQ."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"fputc, putc","note":"writes a character to a file stream"},{"label":"fputws","note":"writes a wide string to a file stream"},{"label":"fgetwc, getwc","note":"gets a wide character from a file stream"}]}]},"standards":[],"wordCount":179,"codeBlockCount":2}
